t", "required": ["symbol", "verdict", "source"], "title": "ShariahReport", "description": "Response of `GET /api/v1/shariah/{symbol}`.\n\nMirrors \u00a75.2 output, extended with cache metadata (see module\ndocstring). In free-tier mode, the 4-checks / methodology /\nraw_ratios fields are empty by design."}, "SynthesisLayerStatus": {"properties": {"verdict": {"type": "string", "title": "Verdict"}, "label": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Label", "description": "Verbose label when the underlying layer publishes one (e.g. \"QUALIT\u00c9 EXCELLENTE\", \"SOUS-\u00c9VALU\u00c9E\"). None otherwise."}, "available": {"type": "boolean", "title": "Available", "description": "False when the underlying service raised an exception. In that case ``verdict`` carries the catch-all string \"ERROR\" and ``error`` holds the short reason."}, "error": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Error", "description": "Short error message; populated iff available=false."}}, "type": "object", "required": ["verdict", "available"], "title": "SynthesisLayerStatus", "description": "Compact per-layer status surfaced in the synthesis banner.\n\n``verdict`` is the raw string from the underlying layer\n(e.g. \"PASS\"/\"FAIL\" for Halal, \"OUI\"/\"NON\"/\"INCERTAIN\" for\nInvestissable, \"OUI\"/\"NON\"/\"OUI_NEUTRE\"/\"IND\u00c9TERMIN\u00c9\" for\nValuation). The frontend maps this onto colour + icon."}, "SynthesisReport": {"properties": {"symbol": {"type": "string", "title": "Symbol"}, "overall_verdict": {"type": "string", "enum": ["INVESTABLE", "NOT_INVESTABLE", "REQUIRES_REVIEW", "BLOCKED"], "title": "Overall Verdict"}, "overall_label": {"type": "string", "title": "Overall Label", "description": "Human-readable French phrase composed from the 3 layer labels \u2014 e.g. 'INVESTISSABLE \u2014 QUALIT\u00c9 EXCELLENTE \u2014 JUSTE PRIX' or '\u00c0 V\u00c9RIFIER MANUELLEMENT'."}, "halal": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/SynthesisLayerStatus"}, "investissable": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/SynthesisLayerStatus"}, "valuation": {"$ref": "#/components/schemas/SynthesisLayerStatus"}, "warnings": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "type": "array", "title": "Warnings"}, "errors": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "type": "array", "title": "Errors", "description": "Layer-level errors. Populated when at least one of the 3 underlying services raised."}, "computed_at": {"type": "string", "format": "date-time", "title": "Computed At"}}, "type": "object", "required": ["symbol", "overall_verdict", "overall_label", "halal", "investissable", "valuation", "computed_at"], "title": "SynthesisReport", "description": "Response of GET /api/v1/synthesis/{symbol}.\n\nAlways returns 200; verdict is in the body (consistent with the\nother 4 endpoints)."}, "TransactionCreate": {"properties": {"symbol": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 20, "minLength": 1, "title": "Symbol"}, "currency": {"type": "string", "maxLength": 3, "minLength": 3, "title": "Currency", "default": "USD"}, "date": {"type": "string", "format": "date", "title": "Date"}, "qty": {"anyOf": [{"type": "number"}, {"type": "string"}], "title": "Qty"}, "price": {"anyOf": [{"type": "number", "exclusiveMinimum": 0.0}, {"type": "string"}], "title": "Price"}, "fee": {"anyOf": [{"type": "number", "minimum": 0.0}, {"type": "string"}], "title": "Fee", "default": "0"}}, "additionalProperties": false, "type": "object", "required": ["symbol", "date", "qty", "price"], "title": "TransactionCreate", "description": "Body of POST /api/v1/portfolio/transactions.\n\nValidation:\n  - symbol non-empty, \u2264 20 chars, auto-uppercased.\n  - currency 3 chars, auto-uppercased. Service rejects \u2260 \"USD\" in V1.\n  - date is the trade date (accept future dates for V1 \u2014 scheduled-buy\n    use-case, no validation).\n  - qty signed, non-zero (positive=BUY, negative=SELL).\n  - price strictly positive.\n  - fee non-negative."}, "TransactionRead": {"properties": {"id": {"type": "string", "format": "uuid", "title"